<title>USA: Four bidders in U.S Stockpile spot tin offer.</title>
<headline>Four bidders in U.S Stockpile spot tin offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four companies bid for a total of 110 tonnes of spot tin from the U.S. Stockpile at prices ranging from $2.6641 to $2.6310 a pound.</p>
<p>The four were Allied Deals, Inc, Ney Smelting &amp; Refining, Cambridge, and Canfield Technologies.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
